  unitName: Drake Queen Aisha
  unitId: 10214
  unitNumber: 289
  description: A dragoon from Julep Village located in Amdahl, with the dragoon techniques
    she learned from the fire dragon she wandered from country to country as a mercenary.
    She received invitations from many countries that were after her precious fighting
    skills, but she refused to go anywhere that didn't have a dragoon army. This
    was because all she was interested in was polishing her own dragoon techniques.
    Before long, she came to be known as the "Drake Lord" by the other dragoons.
  summonDesc: My sword is a beacon of hope.<br>It lights the way for those<br>who
    are lost in the darkness!
  fusionDesc: I know I can get stronger.<br>I have the power, <br>I feel it in my
    bones.
  evoDesc: Ha ha ha...<br>This somehow reminds me of<br>fighting alongside my friend.
  element: 1
  rarity: 4
